  "description": "Your ultimate trail companion\n\nBalanced by design\n\nA 65-degree head angle adds stability while the 78-degree seat angle keeps your weight centered for efficient climbing.\n\nTraction through Tetra-Link\n\n135mm rear and 140mm front travel balance support, grip, and control across changing terrain.\n\nTune it to the trail\n\nGA-Link geometry adjustment and 29er or mullet compatibility let you choose between stability and a more playful ride.\n\nConfidence for the whole mountain\n\nCascade Peak stays composed when the climb gets technical and predictable when the descent opens up—so you can ride farther, push harder, and keep one bike ready for every kind of trail day.",
